	(text "Per leg (rev_a_input_budget.md, architecture 9): 100R and 470p to chassis (RF), TVS to chassis, 1M bleed, coupling cap, inverting stage Rin 20.0k, Rf 5.11k (G = 0.2555, 0 dBFS = +20.1 dBu), + input on VCOMAD, 47R and 10n into the ADC."
